rt	␀␀imu␀touch␀␀␀battery␀sd␀␀usb_hid␀round_panel␀visits␀␀patrols␀new_networks␀␀␀␀threats␀quests_done␀days_away␀␀␀best_score␀␀unset␀␀␀pathfinder␀␀guardian␀␀␀␀archivist␀␀␀cipher␀␀gremlin␀packmaster␀␀curious␀protective␀␀chaotic␀sleepy␀␀greedy␀␀brave␀␀␀care␀␀␀␀explore␀cyber␀␀␀life␀␀␀␀greeting␀␀␀␀idle␀␀␀␀patrol_done␀threat_found␀␀␀␀quest_done␀␀game_win␀␀␀␀game_lose␀␀␀return_after_absence␀␀␀␀hibernate_wake␀␀evolved␀care.feed␀␀␀Feed HexHound twice today.␀␀care.play␀␀␀Play one round of anything.␀care.checkin␀␀␀␀Check on the pet three times.␀␀␀explore.steps␀␀␀Walk 200 steps together.␀␀␀␀explore.shake␀␀␀Wake the pet with a shake.␀␀explore.newnet␀␀Meet five networks you have never seen.␀explore.roam␀␀␀␀Run a patrol somewhere new.␀cyber.patrol␀␀␀␀Run two patrols.␀␀␀␀cyber.triage␀␀␀␀Review one open-network finding.␀␀␀␀cyber.tracker␀␀␀Identify a tracker beacon.␀␀life.focus␀␀Take one 25 minute focus session.␀␀␀life.break␀␀Stand up and stretch twice.␀life.outside␀␀␀␀Go outside for ten minutes.␀Back already. I kept the antenna warm.␀␀You again. That is {n} check-ins now.␀␀␀Oh good, you brought hands. I have questions.␀␀␀Mm. It is you. Five more minutes.␀␀␀Something taps back from inside the shell.␀␀Boots on. Which way are we going?␀␀␀Perimeter is quiet. It stayed that way.␀Listening to the noise floor.␀␀␀Somewhere out there a router is lying about its name.␀␀␀I could break something. Purely for research.␀␀␀Nothing gets past me while you are looking away.␀␀␀␀I have logged {n} networks I had never met before.␀␀The good corners are the ones nobody points at.␀Everything is filed. I could find it in the dark.␀␀␀Give me something that does not want to be read.␀␀␀␀I have been extremely well behaved. Ask nobody.␀It is quieter when it is only the two of us.␀␀␀␀Patrol done. The air is busy today.␀That makes {n} patrols we have walked together.␀Good haul. More packets, more snacks.␀␀␀That one is pretending to be something it is not.␀␀␀I see you. Come closer.␀Stand behind me. I have had my eye on that one.␀Task cleared. Write it in the log.␀␀{n} quests finished. I am keeping score.␀␀␀␀Beat that. I dare you.␀␀Best of {n}. That is my record and I am keeping it.␀We do not talk about that round.␀␀␀␀You were gone {n} days. I counted every one.␀␀␀␀Radios coming back up. Give me a second.␀␀␀␀Something changed. I can feel the new antenna.␀␀I am the whole watch now. Go on, sleep.␀PASS␀␀␀␀WARN␀␀␀␀SKIP␀␀␀␀????␀␀␀␀[HWTest] Display: PASS␀␀/sd␀[HWTest] SD Card: FAIL (init failed)␀␀␀␀[HWTest] SD Card: FAIL (no card)␀␀␀␀[HWTest] SD Card: PASS (%lluMB)
